<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Tiite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tiite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mahanda a Pahuli huli Tiite</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mahanda a Pahuli huli</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIITE</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili muhanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Tiite abeedi tsyengi a Pahuli. Nde akuhasi mambu ma tsongo mu matangu ma pasi, ma Pahuli habwani na mo mutso libundu li musyenge a Koliito. Mu taangu yi Pahuli ali mu usonehele nde muhanda mo wunuuwu, Tiite aba hutso iliiŋa hya Kerete. Huuna, nde li mu ukumbasa libundu la Kristo, mu uvangama.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musonihi muhanda mo wunuuwu, li mu uyibwala Tiite moonyi mu mbiili yi bakuutu ba libundu bafwana uba na yo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1.5-16</ref></char>). Nde li mu uva Tiite mandoongi, mu mbiili yi itwadi yi nde hafwana uba na yo, na pasi muutu mu libundu: baatu ba baakula, pfudu-kaasu, pfudu-mbahala, baviha (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-15">2.1-15</ref></char>). Yisu Kristo ayehuli muvumu a nde, mu uyobolo baatu mu bubi bwa bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:14">2.14</ref></char>). Moonyi Bakristo, asingama mu bungodu bu Yisu hasili bisu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu taangu yi Pahuli hasonihi mihanda huli baana ba nde Timoteho na Tiite, libundu laatsikihi ti Yisu a hulenge yafutaha ve. Buuna, lo lafwana uyiha udyata mu mukami woosi na mu hiitu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Me Pahuli ndi mu utsonehele we muhanda mo wunuuwu. Ni me ndi muviha a Nzambi na iluumbi hya Yisu Kristo. Nzambi amiiva me isalu mu ubita baatu ba nde hamiisoolo, mu nzila imiinu. Nzambi amiiva me ka isalu hi uyabisa bo imbuli hi hyafwana, mana bo badyata mu mbiili ya ba baakiinza Nzambi. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Me ndi mu unzabisa bo imbuli, mana bo baba na hiitu hi ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima wu li mu Nzambi. Moonyi mowuna, Nzambi wu ubaavelepfuta, asiidi bisu nzuhisini umata pangili a tsi. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Mu taangu yi nde hasooli, Nzambi Mufuhisi a bisu, ayabisi mambu ma nde. Ndongisili mo yiina ni yi nde haviidi me mu ulongese baatu. <verse eid="TIT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Ni huli we Tiite, me ndi mu utsonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu. We ni mwana a me wu litondo mu itwadi hi imiinu hi hyapfuuta bisu a we. Nyaha Nzambi Taata na Kristo Yisu Mufuhisi a bisu, basyeme we na uva we hyenze!<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalu hya Tiite hu libundu la Kerete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Me atsiisi we hu iliiŋa hya Kerete, mu umanisala isalu. Na we soolo bakuutu ba libundu mu pasi musyenge, mu usalila tumili yi me apiidi we. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Mukuutu libundu afwana uba wu avele masyembo, na nde utwala uba ikama ve. Baana ba nde baafwana uba na hiitu mu Kristo, na bo utwala umweese imbangi hi ibi mu ndyatili a bo, buuve umweese kene ve. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Pasi mutumi libundu, ahwama na mupfuna a mambu ma Nzambi. Nde afwana ubaaba muutu wu avele na masyembo. Nde utwala uba nga isaayi tso nga makesi ve. Nde utwala uba ikolo-mbungu, tso nga bisongi, tso nga ngaabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nga ngaabi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muutu wu ubaabahila mbongo mu nzila yimbi.</char></note>. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Ka nde afwana uba muyaki a byenyi, buuna ni bubwe. Nde afwana utondo mavaanga ma mabwe, muutu nga tsiki, wu asungama, wa ngidi, wu ayaba ukuka linyutu la nde. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Mukuutu libundu afwana uba muutu wu akangama na mifudi, mu mambu ma mbuli, ma maabaambana na Tsangu ya Mbuli yi bubaalongese nde. Buuna, nde afwana uba muutu wu ubaahwadisa bakima, na wu ubaava bo ndongisili ya mbuli. Nde afwana uba na matwala ma usyembe ba bubaabisa ndongisili a nde.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ayelisi Tiite mu milongisi mi mapfuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Yaabaani ti, hu li na baatu ba banzuhisini ba bubaavelesingala bana na ba bubaapfuta bambaahi mu mambu ma maavele lisunga. Ŋa hati la bo, ba banzuhisini bali Bakristo ba baamata hu bula bu Bayudaayo. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />We afwana ukala bo mu utoyo. Mu tooni ati, bo bali mu udimbasa imiinu hi mabuli ma baatu, mu ubaalongese ma mavelefwana. Bo bali mu ulongese mambu mo maana, mu tooni ati bo bayaka pfuta mu ngaabi. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Mumosi ŋa hati la bisu iliiŋa mo hiina, mumbihuli a bo mwakulu, aleeli bu: «Bisu Kerete bali banga mapfuta pasi taangu. Bo bali bibulu bi bukanyi, babolo na banga mubaka udya.» <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Imbangi mo hinihi, hili hya mbuli. Ni mu buuna, fwengele bo na mifudi, mana bo basa imiinu hya mbuli. <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />Bo babwevelekangama mu masahu ma ikulu hi Bayudaayo. Bo babwevelekangama mu mikele mya baatu ba bali mu utehele mambu ma mbuli mbisa. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Byosi bili bi byatsyeme, huli ba bali batsyeme. Ka isiha tso imosi a hili hi hyatsyeme, huli ba baasumaha na ba baavelesa hiitu ve. Mu tooni ati, buyedi bwa ba baasumaha na matsimi ma mitima mya bo, bili bi byasumaha. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Bo bali mu uleele ti bo baayaba Nzambi. Ka mavaanga ma bo, mali mu umweese ti bo bubaatunala nde. Bo bali banga muwala, ba baavele na lisingala, na ba baavelesa isalu tso imosi hi ibwe.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili huli baatu ba baakula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ka we Tiite, longese ma maayelemene na ndongisili yi yasungama. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Leele huli babahala ba baakula, baba na mbiili yi yasungama na yi butsitu. Bo baafwana uba na tsiki, babaahwada mu imiinu, na mu litondo, na mu mukami.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Leele ka bumosi huli bakaasu ba baakula, bo baba na ndyatili yi yuumweese Nzambi kinya. Bo babaavelekusa, na uveleba baviha ba nwyili malamu yinono. Bo babaalongese ma mabwe, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />mana banuumba batondo balumi na baana ba bo. <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />Bo bafwana uba banga butsitu na ba baatsyeme mu mitima. Bo bafwana uba na bisalili bibibwe, mu manzo ma bo ma makweele. Bo bafwana uluula mu bubwe na mu kulimini ŋa busu bu balumi ba bo. Buuna, muutu tso mumosi a hutwala ubaya mambu ma Nzambi ve.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili huli bafudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Ni bumosi, hwadisa ka pfudu-mbahala, mana baba na tsiki mu bitoyili bya bo. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />We mwakulu Tiite, afwana umweese mbiili yimbwe, mana baatu badukala ifwaani hya we. Ndongisili a we, yafwana uba ya mbuli na yi likiinzu. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Mikuma mya we myafwana uba mi myaleme, mi baatu buuvelesa paha. We usa buuna, bambene ba we buukwa tsonyi, na uvelebaha dyaambu li buusyembe bisu.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili huli baviha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Tuma baviha, basingala bapfumu ba bo mu pasi dyaambu. Bo bafwana ubamweese bapfumu ba bo kinya, mu ubaaveletungalala bo, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />na uveleyibala bo pasi isiha. Ka baviha bafwana umonehele taangu yoosi, basalili bababwe. Moosi ma bo buupalisa, bo baafwana uvangimasa mo. Bo bavanga buuna, baatu sa bava muyusu mu mambu ma bisu libaalongese mu Nzambi Muyobili a bisu.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buli la Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Eye, Nzambi amweesi ma mabwe ma nde, mu tooni ati nde asooli nzila yi uyobolo baatu boosi. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Liyobolo mo lili mu ulongese bisu mu uveletahuha na Nzambi, na ubisa linyungi. Bisu livaanga buuna mu taangu mo yiniiyi, bisu luuba na idingu hya tsiki, hya tsiitsa na hi likiinzu mu Nzambi. <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Ni buuna, bisu lafwana ukeele ilumbu hya kinya hi bisu lili mu usa hiitu. Ilumbu mo hina, Nzambi a bisu wu munene, wu uli Mufuhisi a bisu Yisu Kristo, sa amonehele hutso muyusu a nde. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Nde ayehuli nyutu a nde, mu unyahula ma mabi ma bisu moosi. Eye, nde anyahuli ma mabi ma bisu, mana nde akitula bisu ibaandu hya nde hi hyatsyeme, hi hili na lehemene mu ukuhasa mavaanga ma mabwe. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Ni mu buuna, we afwana ulongese na uhwadisa ba bubaayuhala we. We afwana usyembe libundu na ibahala hyoosi. Ba na buyedi, mana muutu tso mumosi a hapenye we.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kaluha yi Musamu wu Mubwe mu idiingu hya pasi ilumbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Yibwala libundu moonyi, ti lo lafwana uyuhala na usiingala bakuutu na lituma la tsi. Lo lafwana uvangama mu ubaavanga moosi ma mabwe. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Bo muutu utuha ve, mitsotso ve. Ka bo bafwana uba baatu ba hyenze na bababwe, banga bulembo ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Mu tooni ati, bisu ka hu mbandu, laaba biyahudi, banga kene ŋa busu bwa Nzambi na ba baadunga. Bisu aba baviha ba linyungi na makinya ma toto moosi. Idiingu hya bisu aba hutso bukanyi na linyungi. Bisu laakabelele bana na laakabelesene bisu mo na bisu mo. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Ka Nzambi Mufuhisi a bisu, mu taangu yi yafwana, amweesi bubwe bwa nde, na buni nde hafula utondo muutu. <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />Nzambi hafuuhisi bisu, a mu tooni ati bisu laavaanga mambu ma mabwe ve. Naana! Nde hafuuhisi bisu, mu bunene bwa kwili lingebe a nde mu bisu. Nde hafuuhisi bisu, mu taangu yi Livupu la Ngidi laaswahi bisu na laavidi bisu buta li linyatihi. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Nzambi apuhili bisu Livupu mo liina mu iteesi hi hyafulala, mu nzila a Yisu Kristo Mufuhisi a bisu. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Nde hasiidi buuna, mana bu buuteele bisu «ba bamiibinga» mu kolo-kolo a nde, bisu likituha babahi ba hiitu hya moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Mo mali mambu ma mbuli. Na me tondi ti we kwilala mu usilasa misamu mo minimi, mana ba buusa hiitu mu Nzambi, bahwada mu ubaavanga ma mabwe. Mono ma mali ma mabwe, na ma tsongo huli baatu.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbiili a bisu ŋa busu bwa banga buraandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Ka baapeke usobosono hu munywa hu hwavele na lisunga, mu manduhi ma bakaaha ba benu. Kaapeke paha na midiingu mu musamu Mikele mya Moose. Mu tooni ati mbiili mo yiina, a yili ya tsalu na lisunga ve. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Wu ubehe buraandu ŋa hati li libundu, kebese nde kebese latsomi, titswene la moole. Bu nde avelisiinga, we afwana umasa nde mu libundu. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Mu tooni ati, muutu wa pila yina, amiidimbala nzila. Bu nde ali mu ukwilala mu masumu, nde li mu usyembe nyutu a nde mwakulu.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Me tsa tsindaha we Aritemisi na Tisiike. Bu bo buuyato, a hatamba mu uyabiisala me hu musyenge a Nikopolisi, mu tooni ati, ni huuna me upyoso mangala. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Ba na bukuhu mu uva likumbasa huli Zenasi, ngeele mikele, na Apoloosi mu byosi bi bo bali na byo nzala mu mudyenge. Sa buuna, mana bo a bakima mu pasi isiha. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Baatu ba bisu ka bafwana uhwada mu uva linyutu mu uvanga ma mabwe, mana bo bakumbasa ba bali na nzala likumbasa. Bo bavanga buuna, bo sa baba na tsongo.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Boosi ba bali itwadi na me, bamiiva we mabwehe. Va mabwehe huli ba baabaambana na bisu mu imiinu. Nyaha hyese hya Nzambi, hiba na benu boosi.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>